1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,040
This bunker has room

2
00:00:01,060 --> 00:00:03,730
for 100,000 people.

3
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:06,150
100,000 beds,

4
00:00:06,170 --> 00:00:07,810
and every single one

5
00:00:07,830 --> 00:00:09,130
is empty.

6
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:10,350
The blast door won't seal

7
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:11,830
until it's full.

8
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:13,980
So who sleeps down here?

9
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:14,930
You.

10
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:15,810
Everyone who follows

11
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:16,510
gets a bed,

12
00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:18,730
with their name on the door.

13
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:19,510
Right now,

14
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:21,130
there's nobody inside.

15
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:22,290
At 1,000,

16
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:23,580
the lights come on.

17
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:24,740
At 10,000,

18
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,330
the air starts flowing.

19
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:27,690
And at 100,000,

20
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:28,790
the door seals,

21
00:00:28,810 --> 00:00:30,150
and we wait out

22
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:32,110
the end of the world.

23
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:33,740
But there's something

24
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,330
I haven't told you.

25
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:36,170
We thought this bunker

26
00:00:36,190 --> 00:00:38,080
had seven levels.

27
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:38,980
Then we found

28
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,330
an eighth.

29
00:00:40,350 --> 00:00:41,410
There was only one bed

30
00:00:41,430 --> 00:00:42,470
down there.

31
00:00:42,490 --> 00:00:43,980
Bed 000.

32
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:44,900
Its door was locked

33
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,460
from the inside.

34
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:48,500
So we welded

35
00:00:48,520 --> 00:00:50,120
the hatch shut.

36
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:50,760
Pick your spot

37
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:52,260
in the comments.

38
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:53,640
By the garden,

39
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:56,080
next to the armory,

40
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:57,820
or on B7,

41
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:59,980
right above bed 000.

42
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:00,480
Follow me,

43
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:01,340
and get inside

44
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:03,380
before the door closes.
